<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia UPA Corp debuts at 8.80 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia UPA Corp debuts at 8.80 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian printer company UPA Corp Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Wednesday at 8.80 ringgit against an offer price of 2.20 ringgit.</p>
<p>The company had offered 6.6 million shares for sale. The stock is listed on the Second Board of the exchange.</p>
